[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238527\">5580C18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem follow the safety instructions for working on the system carefully\n(\n                                                               <a href=\"#/3238524\">5580C</a>\n                                                                - Precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3238121\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238793\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238525\">5580C12</a></p><p>Closely follow the safety regulations established for this operation.</p><p>1. Loosen the band fixing the steering column switch unit.</p><p>2. Move the steering column switch unit.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections (3a, 3b, 3c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Steering column switch unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236099\">H5A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Steering column switch unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236102\">H5B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3c</p></td><td><p>Steering column switch unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236106\">H5C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3d</p></td><td><p>Steering column switch unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236108\">H5D</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018830.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the steering column\nswitch unit is not damaged and, if necessary, conduct an electrical\ntest on it.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Refit the steering column switch unit.</p><p>Tighten the band fixing the steering column\nswitch unit.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238525\">5580C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238793\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238121\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238527\">5580C18</a></p><p>Check the operation of the systems involved\n(lights, wipers, horns).</p>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238527\">5580C18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>FOLLOW ALL THE RECOMMENDED SAFETY\nRULES (\n                                                               <a href=\"#/3238524\">5580C</a>\n                                                                - Precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3238121\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238793\">7040A26</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Clock spring coupling</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235801\">D47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Release the wiring from the retainer.</p><p>3. Loosen the band fixing the steering column switch unit.</p><p>4. Move the steering column switch unit (4a) after having released\nthe tab (4b) from the tooth on the steering column.</p><p>5. Disconnect the electrical connections (5a, 5b, 5c, 5d, 5e, 5f,\n5g).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5a</p></td><td><p>Steering column switch unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236099\">H5A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5b</p></td><td><p>Steering column switch unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236102\">H5B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5c</p></td><td><p>Steering column switch unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236106\">H5C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5d</p></td><td><p>Steering column switch unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236108\">H5D</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5e</p></td><td><p>Steering column switch unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236111\">H5E</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5f</p></td><td><p>Cruise Control</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236112\">H7</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5g</p></td><td><p>Steering sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236599\">K58</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018831.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,0,"<p>If necessary, \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238525\">5580C12</a></p>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the steering column switch unit\n is intact and shows no signs of damage.</p><p>If necessary, \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238525\">5580C12</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nsteering column.</p><p>Fit the steering column switch unit in\nplace and engage the tab wih the tooth on the steering column.</p><p>Tighten the band fixing the steering column\nswitch unit.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nclock spring and engage the wiring with the retainer.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238793\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238121\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238527\">5580C18</a></p><p>Test the operation of the systems involved\n(lights, wipers, horns, etc.).</p>"]]